    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_body">ACam is a vintage camera. Every effect renders in one shared OpenGL pipeline, so what you see in the viewfinder is exactly what gets saved.\n\nCamera pipeline patterns adapted from Google\'s android/camera-samples and grafika (Apache License 2.0). Filter mathematics inspired by android-gpuimage (Apache License 2.0). Icons are Google Material Symbols (Apache License 2.0). Typeface: Inter by Rasmus Skov (SIL Open Font License 1.1).\n\nACam contains no analytics, no trackers and no internet access.</string>
